// Package configstream carries the processor's data-plane configuration
// (see internal/processor/config.Config) from the controller to each
// processor replica over a long-lived gRPC stream: the controller holds
// the latest compiled config, pushes it to every connected subscriber (on
// connect, and again on every change), and each subscriber acks whether it
// applied the config successfully - giving the controller a per-replica
// signal that a config was actually received and compiled by the data
// plane.
